    ],
    "html": "<section data-contract-page data-page-id=\"dynamic-long-table-page-1\" data-break-type=\"root\">\n        <h1 style=\"text-align: center\">动态超高表格分页示例</h1>\n        <p>甲方代表：<span data-contract-field data-ref-id=\"dynamic-ref-name-party-a\" data-field-id=\"dynamic-name-party-a\" data-field-type=\"text\" data-field-name=\"甲方姓名\" data-width=\"130\"></span></p>\n        <p>乙方员工：<span data-contract-field data-ref-id=\"dynamic-ref-name-party-b\" data-field-id=\"dynamic-name-party-b\" data-field-type=\"text\" data-field-name=\"乙方姓名\" data-width=\"130\"></span></p>\n        <p>模板中只有下方一条数据行；发送协议时按数据库记录动态展开。其中 DB-ITEM-012 的协议说明高度超过一整页，用于验证单条业务记录跨页。</p>\n        <table data-table-id=\"dynamic-long-table\" data-fragment-id=\"dynamic-long-table-fragment-1\">\n          <thead>\n            <tr data-row-id=\"dynamic-long-header-row\"><th><p>明细编码</p></th><th><p>协议说明</p></th><th><p>状态</p></th></tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr data-row-id=\"dynamic-long-template-row\">\n              <td><p><span data-contract-field data-ref-id=\"dynamic-ref-code\" data-field-id=\"dynamic-code-template\" data-field-type=\"text\" data-field-name=\"明细编码\" data-width=\"130\" data-bound-column=\"code\"></span></p></td>\n              <td><p><span data-contract-field data-ref-id=\"dynamic-ref-description\" data-field-id=\"dynamic-description-template\" data-field-type=\"text\" data-field-name=\"协议说明\" data-width=\"400\" data-bound-column=\"description\"></span></p></td>\n              <td><p><span data-contract-field data-ref-id=\"dynamic-ref-status\" data-field-id=\"dynamic-status-template\" data-field-type=\"text\" data-field-name=\"状态\" data-width=\"130\" data-bound-column=\"status\"></span></p></td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n        <p>动态表格尾注：本段必须在数据库全部记录之后出现，不能覆盖、提前或丢失。</p>\n        <p>双方确认已阅读并认可数据库快照生成的全部协议明细。</p>\n        <div data-contract-anchor data-anchor-id=\"dynamic-sign-area\" data-anchor-name=\"动态表格后的签署区域\" data-reserved-height=\"140\"></div>\n        <div data-contract-overlay data-ref-id=\"dynamic-ref-signature-party-a\" data-field-id=\"dynamic-signature-party-a\" data-field-type=\"signature\" data-field-name=\"甲方签名\" data-width=\"170\" data-height=\"70\" data-x=\"20\" data-y=\"0\" data-position-mode=\"anchor\" data-anchor-id=\"dynamic-sign-area\" data-anchor-align=\"left\" data-anchor-offset-x=\"20\" data-anchor-offset-y=\"30\"></div>\n        <div data-contract-overlay data-ref-id=\"dynamic-ref-seal-party-a\" data-field-id=\"dynamic-seal-party-a\" data-field-type=\"companySeal\" data-field-name=\"甲方企业章\" data-width=\"110\" data-height=\"110\" data-x=\"220\" data-y=\"0\" data-position-mode=\"anchor\" data-anchor-id=\"dynamic-sign-area\" data-anchor-align=\"left\" data-anchor-offset-x=\"220\" data-anchor-offset-y=\"10\"></div>\n        <div data-contract-overlay data-ref-id=\"dynamic-ref-signature-party-b\" data-field-id=\"dynamic-signature-party-b\" data-field-type=\"signature\" data-field-name=\"乙方签名\" data-width=\"170\" data-height=\"70\" data-x=\"400\" data-y=\"0\" data-position-mode=\"anchor\" data-anchor-id=\"dynamic-sign-area\" data-anchor-align=\"left\" data-anchor-offset-x=\"400\" data-anchor-offset-y=\"30\"></div>\n      </section>"
  }
}